{"hw":"ζῷον","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ζῷον</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ζῷον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">living being, animal</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.10</span> </span> (of bees), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">V.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">551</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pl.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">443</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">πᾶν ὅ τι περ ἂν μετάσχῃ τοῦ ζῆν ζῷον ἂν λέγοιτο</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ti.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">77b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ζῷα</span>, opp. <span class=\"gk\">φυτά</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phd.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">70d</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">110e</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ζ. θαλάττιον, χερσαῖον</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phld.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.98S.</span> </span>; contemptuously, <span class=\"gk\">ὅπως ἡ χώρα τοῦ τοιούτου ζῴου καθαρὰ γίγνηται</span> may be free from this kind of <b class=\"lex-tr\">animal</b> (i.e. beggars), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">936c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ζ. πονηρόν</span>, of women, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Secund.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sent.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> in art, <b class=\"lex-tr\">figure, image</b>, not necessarily of animals (cf. <span class=\"gk\">ζῴδιον</span>) <span class=\"gk\">, ζῷον δέ οἱ ἐνῆν, ἀνὴρ ἱππεύς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.88</span> </span>: mostly in pl., <span class=\"gk\">ζῷα ἐς τὴν ἐσθῆτα ἐγγράφειν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.203</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.4</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">124</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">148</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">515a</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ζῷα γράψασθαι τὴν ζεῦξιν τοῦ Βοσπόρου</span> to have <b class=\"lex-tr\">pictures</b> of the bridging of the Bosporus painted, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.88</span> </span>; cf. <span class=\"gk\">ζωγραφέω</span>: <span class=\"gk\">ζῷα ποιεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Per.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">sign</b> of the Zodiac, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Man.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.166</span> </span>.—The word is post-<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span>, no generic word used for <b class=\"lex-tr\">animal</b> being found till after the middle of the fifth cent. B.C. ( <span class=\"gk\">ζώϊον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Semon.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">13</span> </span>, whence <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Att.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ζῷον</span> by contraction: <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ι</span> is found in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">IG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.372.42</span> </span>, al.,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11(2).161</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">B</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">76</span> </span> (Delos, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">iii B.C.</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phld.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.166S.</span> </span>, and in codd. opt. in the Noun; the <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adj.</span> <span class=\"gk\">ζωός</span> (q.v.) had no <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ι</span>: for the compds. (exc. <span class=\"gk\">ζωγλύφος, ζωγράφος</span>) decisive evidence is lacking: <span class=\"gk\">ζῳάγρια</span> with <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ι</span> was read by <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aristarch.</span> </span> in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Il.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">18.407</span> </span>.)</div></div>"}